title: BandLeader_Intro
---
<<lock>>
<<setInternal>>
(It’s 3AM.)
(“Witching hour.”)
(But for me, it's just "hour.")
(Seems like the band’s just about wrapping up.)
(It’s the time of night where the weirdos and freaks come in for their post-show fix.)
(Oop. Looks like we got one.)
(Let’s see what this guy’s deal is.)
<<setNormal>>
<<unlock>>
<<stop>>
===

title: BandLeader
