title: BandLeader_Ending_Fursona
---
<<lock>>
<<setNormal>>
<<setsprite "Riff" "riff furry">>
RIFF: AWOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOHLY SHIT! What's happening to me…? #line:riff_fursona_001
RIFF: Is this real? I'm… a wolf? Am I dreaming? #line:riff_fursona_002
RIFF: Lemme let you in on a little secret, potion lady. #line:riff_fursona_003
RIFF: I fucking LOVE wolves. #line:riff_fursona_004
RIFF: I love their awesome silver fur, those big, long snouts… #line:riff_fursona_005
RIFF: Their rugged, muscular bodies… #line:riff_fursona_006
RIFF: But y'know what I love most of all? #line:riff_fursona_007
RIFF: Their sense of community. Their brotherhood. #line:riff_fursona_008
RIFF: That's why I joined the Awoogas, dude. #line:riff_fursona_009
RIFF: I wanted to be a part of something, to know that my pack is always there for me. #line:riff_fursona_010
RIFF: But to them… I was never part of the pack… To them, I was always just… larping. #line:riff_fursona_011
RIFF: But I don't need them anymore. I don't need approval from other wolves anymore. Because now. The wolf is INSIDE ME. #line:riff_fursona_012
RIFF: The Awoogas used to laugh at my moon yodeling… #line:riff_fursona_013
RIFF: But now…But NOW… #line:riff_fursona_014
RIFF: LISTEN TO THE HOWL BOILING INSIDE MY SOUL #line:riff_fursona_015
<<setInternal>>
(Riff goes into an insane moon-yodeling routine.)
(It's somehow shrill and guttural at the same time.)
(Like a bass-boosted mandrake scream.)
(It's really bad, but surprisingly authentic..?)
<<setNormal>>
RIFF: I cannot WAIT to use that in my next song. #line:riff_fursona_016
RIFF: I gotta thank you pretty lady. #line:riff_fursona_017
RIFF: Whatever sick witchery you did with that concoction lifted some baggage I didn't even know I had. #line:riff_fursona_018
RUFF: Now it's time for the world to see who Riff… No… who RUFF…really is. #line:riff_fursona_019
RUFF: I'll see you later, Madame Potion Therapist. #line:riff_fursona_020
RUFF: Or as they say in Lupese… #line:riff_fursona_021
RUFF: AWOOOO WOOF WOOF RRGGH #line:riff_fursona_022
<<unlock>>
<<stop>>
===

title: BandLeader_Ending_Recovery
---
<<lock>>
<<setNormal>>
<<setsprite "Riff" "riff attached">>
RIFF: ...huh? #line:riff_fullrecovery_001
RIFF: Potion lady, is it just me or did you just get even shorter? #line:riff_fullrecovery_002
RIFF: And… I have… free hands? #line:riff_fullrecovery_003
RIFF: Wait, wait, wait, wait… did you… #line:riff_fullrecovery_004
RIFF: My head!? You fixed my head?? #line:riff_fullrecovery_005
RIFF: That's amazing… You're amazing, dude! #line:riff_fullrecovery_006
RIFF: ...
RIFF: But… I think I need to turn this down. #line:riff_fullrecovery_007
<<setInternal>>
(Riff pulls out a pocket knife and… what the fuck he's cutting his head off again.)
(What the fuck. There's blood all over the floor.)
(This shithead snake-for-brains better clean this up after.)
<<setNormal>>
<<setsprite "Riff" "riff unattached">>
RIFF: Don't get me wrong, being beheaded is super tough! #line:riff_fullrecovery_008
RIFF: I have to blend all my meals and pour them down my neck. #line:riff_fullrecovery_009
RIFF: All my dates ever say to me is "my eyes are up here."
RIFF: And no matter how famous I get, my family doesn't really want to associate themselves with a "pathetic head-holder" like me. #line:riff_fullrecovery_011
RIFF: But… I'm proud that I overcame that stuff, y'know? And my head is proof of that. #line:riff_fullrecovery_012
RIFF: It's a part of myself that I actually… kinda like. #line:riff_fullrecovery_013
RIFF: Potion lady… You were really trying to do a good thing for me, huh? #line:riff_fullrecovery_014
RIFF: I guess most people just see my head as a stage prop. Or something I should be ashamed of. #line:riff_fullrecovery_015
RIFF: But you saw my head…and you were… worried for me… #line:riff_fullrecovery_016
<<setInternal>>
(Could be my imagination, but there's a weird mix of loneliness and comfort behind his shades.)
(Whatever it is… I think I might feel it too?)
<<setNormal>>
RIFF: Potion lady… let's see each other again, alright? #line:riff_fullrecovery_017
<<unlock>>
<<stop>>
===

title: BandLeader_Ending_Freedom
---
<<lock>>
<<setNormal>>
<<setsprite "Riff" "riff unattached">>
RIFF: ...
RIFF: Uh… dude? What's that sound? #line:riff_freedom_001
RIFF: This is gonna sound crazy… but it's almost like there's a full band right above my head… #line:riff_freedom_002
<<setInternal>>
(I point to the top of his head. Riff slowly looks upward to his hair.)
<<setNormal>>
RIFF: Woah. Are you shitting me? #line:riff_freedom_003
RIFF: Call me the bathroom at the ogre club after onion casserole night because you GOTTA be shitting me.
RIFF: Tammy!? Since when do you play bass, lil' man? #line:riff_freedom_004
RIFF: Jeb on the drums? And Phil on the keys?? #line:riff_freedom_005
RIFF: ...Gertrude? You're the MANAGER?? #line:riff_freedom_006
RIFF: Holy shit. Potion lady, do you understand what this means? #line:riff_freedom_007
RIFF: I'm a one man band. I can call my OWN shots now. #line:riff_freedom_008
RIFF: No more NORMIES and SELLOUTS fuckin' with my vibe. #line:riff_freedom_009
RIFF: Gertrude, fire my manager! Fire my PR team! Fire my whole fuckin' band! #line:riff_freedom_010
RIFF: Cuz I feel a new SONG coming on..!!! #line:riff_freedom_011
RIFF: I call this one, This Homemade Caviar is Hoppin, And By That I Don't Mean It's Good I Mean I Have 42 Frog Eggs #line:riff_freedom_012
RIFF: Up My Ass (My Frog Neighbor Asked Me To Incubate Them But They Taste Awesome On Crackers So I've Been
RIFF: Eating A Few A Day.) 
<<setInternal>>
(Riff breaks out into song.)
("Song" might be too generous a term.)
(It's utterly incomprehensible.)
(But… seeing Riff have this much fun baring his soul in a shitty convenience store at 3AM…)
(I can't help but tap my fingers to the 29/16 time signature.)
<<setNormal>>
RIFF: I'm telling ya, the world is gonna know my voice! #line:riff_freedom_013
RIFF: Not Shit-zard Lizard Wizard's voice, not the shitty record label's voice, but RIFF'S voice. #line:riff_freedom_014
RIFF: And pretty lady… #line:riff_freedom_015
RIFF: I want you in the front row seats when that time comes, ya hear me? #line:riff_freedom_016
RIFF: Riff out! #line:riff_freedom_017
<<stop>>
<<unlock>>
===

